<title>USA: C-Cube Microsystems joins smallcap index.</title>
<headline>C-Cube Microsystems joins smallcap index.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Wednesday that it will replace BBN Corp in the S&amp;P SmallCap 600 Index with C-Cube Microsystems Inc after the close of trading June 9.</p>
<p>BBN is being acquired by GTE Corp, a component of the S&amp;P 500 Index, in a friendly cash tender offer scheduled to expire on that date.</p>
<p>C-Cube Microsystems develops and markets integrated circuits and software used to compress digital images and video signals.</p>
</text>
